<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Harwill gets JSE approval to list Prospur.</title>
<headline>Harwill gets JSE approval to list Prospur.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Harwill Investments Ltd said on Wednesday it had got approval from the Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) to list its Prospur Packaging and Plastics Ltd unit by way of a renounceable offer for subscription and a renounceable offer for sale.</p>
<p>The company expects the subscription offer to raise five million rand, before expenses, in Prospur and the sale offer to raise eight million rand in Harwill.</p>
<p>The last day to register is July 4.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
